  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Standby Recovery Financing Facility of the Global Facility for Disaster Reduction and Recovery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this TF is to enhance international institutional preparedness for disaster recovery. TF will provide technical assistance to support the development of integrated international approach to disaster recovery before a disaster by drawingup pre-disaster recovery plans, development of tools and guidelines for recovery, and strengthening international mechanisms for recovery activities.</narrative>
  </description>
